# Plain KEY=VALUE lines, read by ci/order.py, ci/fetch_bits.py, ci/publish_release.py, tools/builds.py and tools/release_trx64u.sh (U20 B).
# MC_BUILDS_REPO: the public builds repository this repository shares with TRX64U-MultiCore (U20 D10): the bitstream releases of the builder and the
#   pre-releases of the pipeline. MC_SRC_REPO: the repository whose pushes may publish there (ci/publish_release.py refuses a run of any other).
# BUILDS_TAG_PREFIX: every tag of this repository in the builds repository starts with it, so neither repository's tags can be taken for the other's:
#   <prefix>bit-<entry> (the builder's bitstream release of a ci/keys.sh entry) and <prefix><branch>-<sha8> (the pipeline's pre-release).
#   A proposal for MultiCore until U20 part C confirms it.
MC_BUILDS_REPO=Jondalar/trx64mc-builds
MC_SRC_REPO=Jondalar/TRX64-Ultimate
BUILDS_TAG_PREFIX=fw-
